<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23393" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-grăvo</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a. (<b>poet.</b> and in post-Aug. prose). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To weigh down</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">puppem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 5, 402</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>To cause its weight to be felt</i>, <i>to oppress</i>, <i>molest</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">saevitia hiemis ingravat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					19, 8, 51, § 166</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">annis ingravantibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Phaedr. 5, 10, 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>To render worse</i>, <i>to
			aggravate</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ingravat haec saevus Drances,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 11, 220</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">illa meos casus ingravat, illa levat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Tr. 3, 4, 60</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>To make severe</i> (eccl. Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ingravavit cor suum,</span>”
				<i>he hardened his heart</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Exod. 8, 15</span></i>
			; in <i>pass.</i>, <i><span class="en">ib. 7,
				14 al.</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
